Package: nl.retrotok.app
Name: RetroTok
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Retro TikTok viewer for iOS 6: a full-screen For You feed with swipe-to-next and looping playback. Needs the RetroTok server on your own computer or Raspberry Pi.
